  "title": "Duck Soup (Czarnina)",
  "description": "A rich and fragrant soup for all occasions. An exotic blend of dried prunes, apples, cloves and allspice is nectarous and very complimentary.",
  "authors": [
    "BARB VAN ARKEL"
  ],
